e="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="27" value="" style="endArrow=none;html=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;entryX=1;entryY=0.62;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;entryPerimeter=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c11" target="c8"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="28" value="" style="endArrow=none;html=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;entryX=0;entryY=0.84;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;entryPerimeter=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c12" target="c4"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="29" value="" style="endArrow=none;html=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;entryX=0;entryY=0.16;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;entryPerimeter=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c12" target="c5"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="30" value="" style="endArrow=none;html=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;entryX=0;entryY=0.93;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;entryPerimeter=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c13" target="c4"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="31" value="" style="endArrow=none;html=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;entryX=0;entryY=0.86;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;entryPerimeter=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c13" target="c5"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="32" value="" style="endArrow=none;html=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;entryX=0;entryY=0.84;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;entryPerimeter=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c13" target="c6"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="33" value="" style="endArrow=none;html=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;entryX=0;entryY=0.16;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;entryPerimeter=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c13" target="c7"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="34" value="" style="endArrow=none;html=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;entryX=0;entryY=0.12;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;entryPerimeter=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c13" target="c8"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="35" value="" style="endArrow=none;html=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;entryX=1;entryY=0.15;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;entryPerimeter=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c14" target="c4"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="36" value="" style="endArrow=none;html=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;entryX=1;entryY=0.85;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;entryPerimeter=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c15" target="c5"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="37" value="" style="endArrow=none;html=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;entryX=1;entryY=0.12;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;entryPerimeter=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c15" target="c6"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="38" value="" style="endArrow=none;html=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;entryX=1;entryY=0.2;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;entryPerimeter=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c15" target="c7"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="39" value="" style="endArrow=none;html=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;entryX=1;entryY=0.82;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;entryPerimeter=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c16" target="c7"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="40" value="" style="endArrow=none;html=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;entryX=1;entryY=0.82;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;entryPerimeter=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c17" target="c8"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="41" value="&lt;b&gt;Notes&lt;/b&gt; — Actors as in the Business Context Diagram: 4 human roles (Investor, Operator, Customer, Platform Administrator; the Administrator also holds the separate Evidence Reviewer permission used in UC47) and 4 external systems (eKYC Provider, Viettel signing, payment intermediary, simulated farm devices and cameras). An Investor may act as a Customer (generalization in SD4a and SD4b). Codes keep the UC01 form used in Jira and the feature map. &lt;b&gt;Subsystems and Register v1.4 components&lt;/b&gt;: SD1 ↔ identity (eKYC, roles); SD2 ↔ Batch funding with a locked Standard Cost (UC49 price suggestion is used when the Operator sets the price); SD3 ↔ production tracking and evidence verification, plus harvest per box; SD4 ↔ bulk pre-sales and delivery; SD5 ↔ settlement, with audit and reporting (UC42, UC43). &lt;b&gt;Background jobs&lt;/b&gt; are system behaviour, not actors; their triggers go to the Precondition/Trigger column of the Use Case List: reservation expiry (30 minutes after reserving), funding close (funding deadline or maximum capital), refunds (Batch cancelled), alert escalation (acknowledgement deadline), random capture request (schedule), final-order reminder (sales window closes), order completion (return window ends). The Investor is linked to all five subsystems, like the Operator and the Administrator, so four crossings are unavoidable (the graph contains K3,5); the payment intermediary and the Customer add one each (keeping the four external systems in one frame).&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Removed in v1.4 (still in code)&lt;/b&gt;, codes not reused: UC13 Register Offtake Commitment (investor offtake removed); UC23 Claim Priority Offtake Volume (priority offtake window removed); UC24 Publish Product Listings (listings removed); UC26 Place Order (retail sales and cart removed); UC46 Print and Activate Crab Tag (per-crab tags removed; harvest per box and order QR instead).&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;New in v1.4 («planned»)&lt;/b&gt;: UC49 Get Sale Price Range Suggestion, UC50 Record Invoiced Sale, UC51 Record Final Order at Floor Price, UC52 Submit Farm Device and Camera Data, UC53 View Box Details of Own Rows, UC54 Forfeit Deposit («extend» UC55, UC30). UC55 Cancel Bulk Pre-order exists in code; its v1.4 forfeit rule is «planned».&lt;br&gt;Design decisions of 05/11/2026 applied here were confirmed by the lead.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Legend&lt;/b&gt; (UML 2.5) — ellipse = use case (code + name); dashed grey with «planned» = in Register v1.4, not yet on develop @ 420a379; grey line &quot;v1.4: … «planned»&quot; = the use case exists, the v1.4 additions do not; grey fill = use case defined in another subsystem. Solid line = association (the actor takes part); hollow-triangle arrow = generalization (the child actor can do what the parent does); dashed arrow = «include» (base → included) or «extend» (extension → base, extension point and condition in the notes)." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=14;fillColor=#fffbeb;strokeColor=#d97706;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=6;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Segoe UI;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="1031" width="1600" height="217" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram><diagram name="SD1 – Identity &amp; Onboarding" id="SD1___Identity__amp__Onboarding"><mxGraphModel dx="1200" dy="800" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1654" pageHeight="1169" math="0" shadow="0"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="2" value="&lt;b&gt;Figure 2.2 – Use Case Diagram: SD1 Identity &amp; Onboarding (UC01–UC06)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot; color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;v3.2 · 05/11/2026 · Register v1.4&lt;/font&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=15;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="10" width="1200" height="46" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c3" value="CrabShare System · SD1 Identity &amp; Onboarding" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=none;strokeColor=#1e293b;strokeWidth=1.5;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=4;fontStyle=1;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=13;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="410" y="100" width="636" height="674" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c4" value="&lt;b&gt;UC01&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Register Account" style="ellipse;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#1e293b;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Segoe UI;spacing=3;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="429" y="156" width="262" height="88" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c5" value="&lt;b&gt;UC03&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Maintain Payout Account" style="ellipse;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#1e293b;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Segoe UI;spacing=3;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="429" y="281" width="262" height="88" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c6" value="&lt;b&gt;UC02&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Complete Identity Verification (eKYC)" style="ellipse;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#1e293b;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Segoe UI;spacing=3;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="429" y="406" width="262" height="88" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c7" value="&lt;b&gt;UC06&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Authorise Identity Verification Exception" style="ellipse;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#1e293b;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Segoe UI;spacing=3;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="429" y="531" width="262" height="88" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c8" value="&lt;b&gt;UC05&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Review Operator Application" style="ellipse;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#1e293b;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Segoe UI;spacing=3;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="429" y="656" width="262" height="88" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c9" value="&lt;b&gt;UC04&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Submit Operator Application" style="ellipse;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#1e293b;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Segoe UI;spacing=3;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="749" y="156" width="262" height="88" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c10" value="Customer" style="shape=umlActor;verticalLabelPosition=bottom;vertical