="18" value="" style="endArrow=none;html=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c11" target="c5"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="19" value="" style="endArrow=none;html=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;entryX=1;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c13" target="c5"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="20" value="" style="endArrow=none;html=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c11" target="c6"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="21" value="" style="endArrow=none;html=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;entryX=1;entryY=0.38;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c13" target="c6"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="22" value="" style="endArrow=none;html=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;entryX=1;entryY=0.62;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c14" target="c6"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="23" value="" style="endArrow=none;html=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c12" target="c7"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="24" value="" style="endArrow=none;html=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c12" target="c8"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="25" value="" style="endArrow=none;html=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;entryX=1;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c13" target="c9"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="26" value="&lt;b&gt;Notes&lt;/b&gt; — UC02 stores only the verification result; ID images never persist. UC06 is the Platform Administrator's own goal — precondition: {the eKYC check failed or the provider is unavailable}; the Administrator records the manual exception. Customers register (UC01) but need no eKYC or payout account in Register v1.4.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Legend&lt;/b&gt; (UML 2.5) — ellipse = use case (code + name); dashed grey with «planned» = in Register v1.4, not yet on develop @ 420a379; grey line &quot;v1.4: … «planned»&quot; = the use case exists, the v1.4 additions do not; grey fill = use case defined in another subsystem. Solid line = association (the actor takes part); hollow-triangle arrow = generalization (the child actor can do what the parent does); dashed arrow = «include» (base → included) or «extend» (extension → base, extension point and condition in the notes)." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=14;fillColor=#fffbeb;strokeColor=#d97706;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=6;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Segoe UI;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="410" y="794" width="940" height="127" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram><diagram name="SD2 – Batch &amp; Investment" id="SD2___Batch__amp__Investment"><mxGraphModel dx="1200" dy="800" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1654" pageHeight="1244" math="0" shadow="0"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="2" value="&lt;b&gt;Figure 2.3 – Use Case Diagram: SD2 Batch &amp; Investment (UC07–UC16, UC49)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot; color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;v3.2 · 05/11/2026 · Register v1.4&lt;/font&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=15;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="10" width="1200" height="46" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c3" value="CrabShare System · SD2 Batch &amp; Investment" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=none;strokeColor=#1e293b;strokeWidth=1.5;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=4;fontStyle=1;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=13;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="410" y="100" width="656" height="877" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c4" value="&lt;b&gt;UC09&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Explore Batch Offerings" style="ellipse;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#1e293b;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Segoe UI;spacing=3;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="429" y="151" width="262" height="88" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c5" value="&lt;b&gt;UC16&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Track Investment Portfolio" style="ellipse;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#1e293b;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Segoe UI;spacing=3;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="429" y="269" width="262" height="88" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c6" value="&lt;b&gt;UC11&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Acknowledge Investment Risk" style="ellipse;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#1e293b;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Segoe UI;spacing=3;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="429" y="387" width="262" height="88" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c7" value="&lt;b&gt;UC10&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Reserve Box Rows and Commit Capital&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot; color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;v1.4: box-row choice «planned»&lt;/font&gt;" style="ellipse;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#1e293b;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Segoe UI;spacing=3;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="429" y="505" width="262" height="88" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c8" value="&lt;b&gt;UC14&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Sign Investment Contract" style="ellipse;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#1e293b;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Segoe UI;spacing=3;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="429" y="623" width="262" height="88" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c9" value="&lt;b&gt;UC07&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Create Batch by Box Rows and Define Standard Cost&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot; color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;v1.4: rows, prices, tiers, radius «planned»&lt;/font&gt;" style="ellipse;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#1e293b;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Segoe UI;spacing=3;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="429" y="741" width="262" height="88" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c10" value="&lt;b&gt;UC49&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Get Sale Price Range Suggestion&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot; color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;«planned»&lt;/font&gt;" style="ellipse;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#64748b;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Segoe UI;spacing=3;dashed=1;dashPattern=6 4;fontColor=#64748b;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="429" y="859" width="262" height="88" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c11" value="&lt;b&gt;UC12&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Make Payment (VietQR)" style="ellipse;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#1e293b;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Segoe UI;spacing=3;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="769" y="505" width="262" height="88" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c12" value="&lt;b&gt;UC15&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Upload Offline-Signed Contract" style="ellipse;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#1e293b;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Segoe UI;spacing=3;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="769" y="741" width="262" height="88" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c13" value="&lt;b&gt;UC08&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Review and Approve Batch&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot; color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;v1.4: floor price, tiers «planned»&lt;/font&gt;" style="ellipse;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#1e293b;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Segoe UI;spacing=3;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="769" y="859" width="262" height="88" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c14" value="Investor" style="shape=umlActor;verticalLabelPosition=bottom;verticalAlign=top;html=1;outlineConnect=0;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=13;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="140" y="384.2" width="40" height="70" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c15" value="Operator" style="shape=umlActor;verticalLabelPosition=bottom;verticalAlign=top;html=1;outlineConnect=0;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=13;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="140" y="791.3" width="40" height="70" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c16" value="«actor»&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Payment Service Provider (payment intermediary)&lt;/b&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;dashed=0;fillColor=#f8fafc;strokeColor=#475569;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1145" y="518" width="190" height="62" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c17" value="«actor»&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Digital Signature Service (Viettel)&lt;/b&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;dashed=0;fillColor=#f8fafc;strokeColor=#475569;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1145" y="636" width="190" height="62" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c18" value="Platform Administrator" style="shape=umlActor;verticalLabelPosition=bottom;verticalAlign=top;html=1;outlineConnect=0;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=13;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1220" y="809" width="40" height="70" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="19" value="" style="endArrow=none;html=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c14" target="c4"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="20" value="" style="endArrow=none;html=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c14" target="c5"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="21" value="" style="endArrow=none;html=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c14" target="c6"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="22" value="" style="endArrow=none;html=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c14" target="c7"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="23" value="" style="endArrow=none;html=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;entryX=0;entryY=0.38;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c14" target="c8"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="24" value="" style="endArrow=none;html=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;entryX=0;entryY=0.62;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c15" target="c8"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="25" value="" style="endArrow=none;html=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;entryX=1;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c17" target="c8"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="26" value="" style="endArrow=none;html=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c15" target="c9"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="27" value="" style="endArrow=none;html=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c15" target="c10"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="28" value="" style="endArrow=none;html=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;entryX=1;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c16" target="c11"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="29" value="" style="endArrow=none;html=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;entryX=1;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c18" target="c12"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="30" value="" style="endArrow=none;html=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;entryX=1;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c18" target="c13"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="31" value="«include»" style="endArrow=open;endFill=0;dashed=1;html=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Segoe UI;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c7" target="c11"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="32" value="&lt;b&gt;Notes&lt;/b&gt; — UC07 groups the Batch's boxes into box rows by their row code (a BoxRow belongs to the Batch; each row's capital is at least the platform minimum contribution) and locks, at funding open, the Standard Cost with the price per kg and the floor price; UC49 is used while setting the price per kg and shows a range with a warning, never an expected return. UC08 also approves the floor price and the remuneration tiers. UC11 is a precondition of UC10 (risk disclosure accepted). UC10: the investor picks free box rows, each row going to one investor only; the amount is the sum of the chosen rows' capital (boxes × Standard Cost per box), so the minimum contribution is one row; it is paid once in full (UC12, VietQR) and the rows are held 30 minutes, never past the funding deadline. The Batch opens when the minimum viable capital is reached AND the pre-order ratio ≥ the minimum; otherwise it is cancelled and investors and depositing Customers are refunded; between the minimum and the target only the boxes of funded rows are stocked and capital that cannot become boxes is refunded. UC14: Operator signs first, then the Investor (Viettel); signing and paying can happen in either order. UC15 is the Platform Administrator's own goal — precondition: {the contract was signed on paper}. Design decisions of 05/11/2026 applied here were confirmed by the lead.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Legend&lt;/b&gt; (UML 2.5) — ellipse = use case (code + name); dashed grey with «planned» = in Register v1.4, not yet on develop @ 420a379; grey line &quot;v1.4: … «planned»&quot; = the use case exists, the v1.4 additions do not; grey fill = use case defined in another subsystem. Solid line = association (the actor takes part); hollow-triangle arrow = generalization (the child actor can do what the parent does); dashed arrow = «include» (base → included) or «extend» (extension → base, extension point and condition in the notes)." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=14;fillColor=#fffbeb;strokeColor=#d97706;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=6;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Segoe UI;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="410" y="997" width="940" height="217" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram><diagram name="SD3 – Production, Evidence &amp; Harvest" id="SD3___Production__Evidence__amp__Harvest"><mxGraphModel dx="1200" dy="800" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1654" pageHeight="1281" math="0" shadow="0"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="2" value="&lt;b&gt;Figure 2.4 – Use Case Diagram: SD3 Production, Evidence &amp; Harvest (UC17–UC22, UC44–UC48, UC52–UC53)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot; color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;v3.2 · 05/11/2026 · Register v1.4&lt;/font&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=15;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="10" width="1200" height="46" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c3" value="CrabShare System · SD3 Production, Evidence &amp; Harvest" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=none;strokeColor=#1e293b;strokeWidth=1.5;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=4;fontStyle=1;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=13;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="410" y="100" width="676" height="944" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c4" value="&lt;b&gt;UC44&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Register Boxes and Box Rows" style="ellipse;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#1e293b;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Segoe UI;spacing=3;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="429" y="156" width="262" height="88" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c5" value="&lt;b&gt;UC17&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Record Production Logs and Box Events" style="ellipse;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#1e293b;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Segoe UI;spacing=3;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="429" y="266" width="262" height="88" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c6" value="&lt;b&gt;UC45&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Capture Production Evidence" style="ellipse;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#1e293b;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Segoe UI;spacing=3;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="429" y="376" width="262" height="88" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c7" value="&lt;b&gt;UC48&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Submit Evidence Explanation" style="ellipse;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#1e293b;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Segoe UI;spacing=3;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="429" y="486" width="262" height="88" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c8" value="&lt;b&gt;UC19&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Acknowledge Operations Alert" style="ellipse;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#1e293b;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Segoe UI;spacing=3;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="429" y="596" width="262" height="88" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c9" value="&lt;b&gt;UC18&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Request Milestone Disbursement" style="ellipse;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#1e293b;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Segoe UI;spacing=3;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="429" y="706" width="262" height="88" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c10" value="&lt;b&gt;UC21&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;View Production Timeline" style="ellipse;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#1e293b;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Segoe UI;spacing=3;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="429" y="816" width="262" height="88" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c11" value="&lt;b&gt;UC22&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Record Harvest per Box" style="ellipse;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#1e293b;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Segoe UI;spacing=3;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="429" y="926" width="262" height="88" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c12" value="&lt;b&gt;UC52&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Submit Farm Device and Camera Data&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot; color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;«planned»&lt;/font&gt;" style="ellipse;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#64748b;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Segoe UI;spacing=3;dashed=1;dashPattern=6 4;fontColor=#64748b;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="789" y="266" width="262" height="88" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c13" value="&lt;b&gt;UC47&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Review Flagged Evidence" style="ellipse;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#1e293b;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Segoe UI;spacing=3;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="789" y="486" width="262" height="88" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c14" value="&lt;b&gt;UC20&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Monitor Escalated Alerts" style="ellipse;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#1e293b;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Segoe UI;spacing=3;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="789" y="596" width="262" height="88" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c15" value="&lt;b&gt;UC53&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;View Box Details of Own Rows&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot; color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;«planned»&lt;/font&gt;" style="ellipse;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#64748b;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Segoe UI;spacing=3;dashed=1;dashPattern=6 4;fontColor=#64748b;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="789" y="926" width="262" height="88" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c16" value="Operator" style="shape=umlActor;verticalLabelPosition=bottom;verticalAlign=top;html=1;outlineConnect=0;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=13;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="140" y="550" width="40" height="70" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c17" value="«actor»&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Farm Devices &amp;amp; Cameras (simulated)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;«planned»" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;dashed=1;fillColor=#f8fafc;strokeColor=#64748b;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=12;dashPattern=6 4;fontColor=#64748b;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1175" y="275" width="190" height="70" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c18" value="Platform Administrator" style="shape=umlActor;verticalLabelPosition=bottom;verticalAlign=top;html=1;outlineConnect=0;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=13;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1250" y="605" width="40" height="70" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c19" value="Investor" style="shape=umlActor;verticalLabelPosition=bottom;verticalAlign=top;html=1;outlineConnect=0;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=13;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1250" y="935" width="40" height="70" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="20" value="" style="endArrow=none;html=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c16" target="c4"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="21" value="" style="endArrow=none;html=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c16" target="c5"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="22" value="" style="endArrow=none;html=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c16" target="c6"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="23" value="" style="endArrow=none;html=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c16" target="c7"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="24" value="" style="endArrow=none;html=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c16" target="c8"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="25" value="" style="endArrow=none;html=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c16" target="c9"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="26" value="" style="endArrow=none;html=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;entryX=1;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c18" target="c9"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="27" value="" style="endArrow=none;html=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c16" target="c10"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="28" value="" style="endArrow=none;html=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;entryX=1;entryY=0.38;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c18" target="c10"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="29" value="" style="endArrow=none;html=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;entryX=1;entryY=0.62;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c19" target="c10"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="30" value="" style="endArrow=none;html=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c16" target="c11"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="31" value="" style="endArrow=none;html=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;entryX=1;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c17" target="c12"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="32" value="" style="endArrow=none;html=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;entryX=1;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c18" target="c13"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="33" value="" style="endArrow=none;html=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;entryX=1;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c18" target="c14"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="34" value="" style="endArrow=none;html=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;entryX=1;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c19" target="c15"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="35" value="&lt;b&gt;Notes&lt;/b&gt; — UC44 registers boxes with their row code and number; the box rows of a Batch are formed from these codes in UC07 (a BoxRow belongs to the Batch). UC45: live in-app photo with server time, location, box number and SHA-256 hash; the crab-detection module («planned», the code uses a no-op detector) only checks that a crab is present and adds to the risk score, never rejecting alone; doubtful evidence goes to UC47 (Evidence Reviewer permission, never on own investments). UC48 precondition: {evidence Flagged}. UC52: the simulated farm devices and cameras send photos, feeding records, box events and logs through one common data channel. UC53: an investor sees box details only for own rows; others see Batch-level figures in UC21, which the Platform Administrator also follows. UC18: the Platform Administrator releases, asks for an explanation or blocks the tranche. UC22 records harvest per box; per-crab tags are dropped. Design decisions of 05/11/2026 applied here were confirmed by the lead.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Legend&lt;/b&gt; (UML 2.5) — ellipse = use case (code + name); dashed grey with «planned» = in Register v1.4, not yet on develop @ 420a379; grey line &quot;v1.4: … «planned»&quot; = the use case exists, the v1.4 additions do not; grey fill = use case defined in another subsystem. Solid line = association (the actor takes part); hollow-triangle arrow = generalization (the child actor can do what the parent does); dashed arrow = «include» (base → included) or «extend» (extension → base, extension point and condition in the notes)." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=14;fillColor=#fffbeb;strokeColor=#d97706;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=6;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Segoe UI;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="410" y="1064" width="940" height="187" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram><diagram name="SD4a – Sales — Pre-order, Payment &amp; Receipt" id="SD4a___Sales___Pre_order__Payment__amp__Receipt"><mxGraphModel dx="1200" dy="800" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1654" pageHeight="1169" math="0" shadow="0"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="2" value="&lt;b&gt;Figure 2.5a – Use Case Diagram: SD4a Sales — Pre-order, Payment &amp; Receipt (UC25, UC27, UC28, UC30, UC54, UC55)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot; color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;v3.2 · 05/11/2026 · Register v1.4&lt;/font&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=15;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="10" width="1200" height="46" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c3" value="CrabShare System · SD4a Sales — Pre-order, Payment &amp; Receipt" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=none;strokeColor=#1e293b;strokeWidth=1.5;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=4;fontStyle=1;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=13;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="410" y="100" width="656" height="779" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c4" value="&lt;b&gt;UC27&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Place Bulk Pre-order with Deposit&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot; color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;v1.4: crab count, minimum qty, while funding, no listing «planned»&lt;/font&gt;" style="ellipse;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#1e293b;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Segoe UI;spacing=3;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="429" y="161" width="262" height="88" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c5" value="&lt;b&gt;UC55&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Cancel Bulk Pre-order&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot; color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;v1.4: forfeit once the Batch opens «planned»&lt;/font&gt;" style="ellipse;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#1e293b;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Segoe UI;spacing=3;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="429" y="281" width="262" height="88" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c6" value="&lt;b&gt;UC54&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Forfeit Deposit&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot; color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;«planned»&lt;/font&gt;" style="ellipse;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#64748b;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Segoe UI;spacing=3;dashed=1;dashPattern=6 4;fontColor=#64748b;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="429" y="401" width="262" height="88" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c7" value="&lt;b&gt;UC25&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Find Farms and Batches on Map&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot; color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;«planned»&lt;/font&gt;" style="ellipse;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#64748b;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Segoe UI;spacing=3;dashed=1;dashPattern=6 4;fontColor=#64748b;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="429" y="641" width="262" height="88" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c8" value="&lt;b&gt;UC28&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Track Order Status" style="ellipse;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#1e293b;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Segoe UI;spacing=3;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="429" y="761" width="262" height="88" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c9" value="&lt;b&gt;UC12&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Make Payment (VietQR)&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot; color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;(defined in SD2)&lt;/font&gt;" style="ellipse;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f1f5f9;strokeColor=#1e293b;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Segoe UI;spacing=3;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="769" y="161" width="262" height="88" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c10" value="&lt;b&gt;UC30&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Confirm Receipt and Pay Balance&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot; color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;v1.4: balance on weighed kg «planned»&lt;/font&gt;" style="ellipse;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#1e293b;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Segoe UI;spacing=3;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="769" y="473" width="262" height="88" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c11" value="Investor" style="shape=umlActor;verticalLabelPosition=bottom;verticalAlign=top;html=1;outlineConnect=0;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=13;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="46" y="518" width="40" height="70" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c12" value="Customer" style="shape=umlActor;verticalLabelPosition=bottom;verticalAlign=top;html=1;outlineConnect=0;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=13;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="140" y="518" width="40" height="70" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c13" value="«actor»&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Payment Service Provider (payment intermediary)&lt;/b&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;dashed=0;fillColor=#f8fafc;strokeColor=#475569;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1145" y="174" width="190" height="62" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="14" value="" style="endArrow=block;endFill=0;html=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;endSize=12;fontFamily=Segoe UI;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;exitPerimeter=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;entryPerimeter=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c11" target="c12"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="15" value="" style="endArrow=none;html=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c12" target="c4"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="16" value="" style="endArrow=none;html=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c12" target="c5"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="17" value="" style="endArrow=none;html=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c12" target="c7"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="18" value="" style="endArrow=none;html=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c12" target="c8"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="19" value="" style="endArrow=none;html=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;entryX=1;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c13" target="c9"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="20" value="" style="endArrow=none;html=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c12" target="c10"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="21" value="«include»" style="endArrow=open;endFill=0;dashed=1;html=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Segoe UI;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c4" target="c9"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="22" value="«include»" style="endArrow=open;endFill=0;dashed=1;html=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Segoe UI;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c10" target="c9"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="23" value="«extend»" style="endArrow=open;endFill=0;dashed=1;html=1;strokeColor=#64748b;edgeStyle=none;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Segoe UI;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontColor=#64748b;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c6" target="c5"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="24" value="«extend»" style="endArrow=open;endFill=0;dashed=1;html=1;strokeColor=#64748b;edgeStyle=none;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Segoe UI;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontColor=#64748b;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c6" target="c10"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="25" value="&lt;b&gt;Notes&lt;/b&gt; — The Investor inherits every Customer use case (generalization) {not the Batch's Operator or its related parties}. UC27: bulk pre-order by number of crabs (or kg) from the minimum quantity, deposit by VietQR while the Batch is funding; no overselling of the crabs open for pre-order. UC55: cancelling before the deposit is paid costs nothing (as when the 15-minute QR expires); a pre-order cancelled after the deposit is refunded if the Batch does not open. UC30: the Customer checks the crabs and pays the balance = weighed kg × price per kg − deposit, where weighed kg is the live crabs received (dead or spoiled crabs excluded, the transit loss only recorded); a negative balance is refunded. UC54 Forfeit Deposit «extend» UC55 — extension point: cancellation after the deposit; condition: {the Batch opened}; «extend» UC30 — extension point: delivery; condition: {the Customer refuses delivery or does not pay the balance}. The deposit becomes Batch revenue (ForfeitedDeposit) and, in the UC30 case, the crabs are resold through UC50 (InvoicedSale, Figure 2.5b). When the Batch does not open every deposit is refunded, cancelled orders included. Design decisions of 05/11/2026 applied here were confirmed by the lead.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Legend&lt;/b&gt; (UML 2.5) — ellipse = use case (code + name); dashed grey with «planned» = in Register v1.4, not yet on develop @ 420a379; grey line &quot;v1.4: … «planned»&quot; = the use case exists, the v1.4 additions do not; grey fill = use case defined in another subsystem. Solid line = association (the actor takes part); hollow-triangle arrow = generalization (the child actor can do what the parent does); dashed arrow = «include» (base → included) or «extend» (extension → base, extension point and condition in the notes)." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=14;fillColor=#fffbeb;strokeColor=#d97706;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=6;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Segoe UI;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="410" y="899" width="940" height="202" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram><diagram name="SD4b – Sales — Delivery, Returns &amp; Invoiced Orders" id="SD4b___Sales___Delivery__Returns__amp__Invoiced_Orders"><mxGraphModel dx="1200" dy="800" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1654" pageHeight="1169" math="0" shadow="0"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="2" value="&lt;b&gt;Figure 2.5b – Use Case Diagram: SD4b Sales — Delivery, Returns &amp; Invoiced Orders (UC29, UC31–UC34, UC50–UC51)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot; color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;v3.2 · 05/11/2026 · Register v1.4&lt;/font&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=15;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="10" width="1200" height="46" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c3" value="CrabShare System · SD4b Sales — Delivery, Returns &amp; Invoiced Orders" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=none;strokeColor=#1e293b;strokeWidth=1.5;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=4;fontStyle=1;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=13;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="410" y="100" width="656" height="539" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c4" value="&lt;b&gt;UC31&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Submit Return or Complaint" style="ellipse;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#1e293b;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Segoe UI;spacing=3;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="429" y="161" width="262" height="88" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c5" value="&lt;b&gt;UC34&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Rate Order" style="ellipse;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#1e293b;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Segoe UI;spacing=3;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="429" y="281" width="262" height="88" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c6" value="&lt;b&gt;UC33&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Trace Order by QR Code&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot; color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;«planned»&lt;/font&gt;" style="ellipse;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#64748b;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Segoe UI;spacing=3;dashed=1;dashPattern=6 4;fontColor=#64748b;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="429" y="401" width="262" height="88" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c7" value="&lt;b&gt;UC29&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Deliver Order and Record Weighed Quantity&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot; color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;v1.4: weighed kg, transit loss «planned»&lt;/font&gt;" style="ellipse;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#1e293b;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Segoe UI;spacing=3;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="769" y="161" width="262" height="88" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c8" value="&lt;b&gt;UC50&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Record Invoiced Sale&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot; color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;«planned»&lt;/font&gt;" style="ellipse;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#64748b;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Segoe UI;spacing=3;dashed=1;dashPattern=6 4;fontColor=#64748b;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="769" y="281" width="262" height="88" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c9" value="&lt;b&gt;UC51&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Record Final Order at Floor Price&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot; color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;«planned»&lt;/font&gt;" style="ellipse;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#64748b;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Segoe UI;spacing=3;dashed=1;dashPattern=6 4;fontColor=#64748b;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="769" y="401" width="262" height="88" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c10" value="&lt;b&gt;UC32&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Resolve Order Complaint" style="ellipse;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#1e293b;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Segoe UI;spacing=3;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="769" y="521" width="262" height="88" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c11" value="Investor" style="shape=umlActor;verticalLabelPosition=bottom;verticalAlign=top;html=1;outlineConnect=0;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=13;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="46" y="290" width="40" height="70" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c12" value="Customer" style="shape=umlActor;verticalLabelPosition=bottom;verticalAlign=top;html=1;outlineConnect=0;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=13;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="140" y="290" width="40" height="70" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c13" value="Operator" style="shape=umlActor;verticalLabelPosition=bottom;verticalAlign=top;html=1;outlineConnect=0;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=13;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1220" y="314" width="40" height="70" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c14" value="Platform Administrator" style="shape=umlActor;verticalLabelPosition=bottom;verticalAlign=top;html=1;outlineConnect=0;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=13;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1220" y="518" width="40" height="70" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="15" value="" style="endArrow=block;endFill=0;html=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;endSize=12;fontFamily=Segoe UI;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;exitPerimeter=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;entryPerimeter=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c11" target="c12"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="16" value="" style="endArrow=none;html=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c12" target="c4"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="17" value="" style="endArrow=none;html=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c12" target="c5"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="18" value="" style="endArrow=none;html=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c12" target="c6"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="19" value="" style="endArrow=none;html=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;entryX=1;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c13" target="c7"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="20" value="" style="endArrow=none;html=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;entryX=1;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c13" target="c8"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="21" value="" style="endArrow=none;html=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;entryX=1;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c13" target="c9"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="22" value="" style="endArrow=none;html=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;entryX=1;entryY=0.38;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c13" target="c10"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="23" value="" style="endArrow=none;html=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;entryX=1;entryY=0.62;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c14" target="c10"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="24" value="&lt;b&gt;Notes&lt;/b&gt; — The Investor inherits the Customer use cases (generalization) {not the Batch's Operator or its related parties}. UC29: delivery with the crabs weighed at the door; the transit loss is recorded, not charged and not deducted again. UC31 precondition: {order Delivered, within the return window}; it covers return requests and complaints, which the Operator answers and UC32 resolves. UC34 precondition: {order Completed}. UC33: the QR code printed on the delivery note opens the farm, Batch and harvest record, without login. UC50 Record Invoiced Sale: one invoiced order type (InvoicedSale) for low-grade crabs and for crabs resold after a forfeited order. UC51: leftover stock goes to the committed buyer (outside the system) through one final order (FinalOrder), never below the floor price. Every delivered order (bulk pre-order, invoiced sale, final order) has an invoice. Design decisions of 05/11/2026 applied here were confirmed by the lead.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Legend&lt;/b&gt; (UML 2.5) — ellipse = use case (code + name); dashed grey with «planned» = in Register v1.4, not yet on develop @ 420a379; grey line &quot;v1.4: … «planned»&quot; = the use case exists, the v1.4 additions do not; grey fill = use case defined in another subsystem. Solid line = association (the actor takes part); hollow-triangle arrow = generalization (the child actor can do what the parent does); dashed arrow = «include» (base → included) or «extend» (extension → base, extension point and condition in the notes)." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=14;fillColor=#fffbeb;strokeColor=#d97706;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=6;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Segoe UI;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="410" y="659" width="940" height="187" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram><diagram name="SD5 – Settlement &amp; Oversight" id="SD5___Settlement__amp__Oversight"><mxGraphModel dx="1200" dy="800" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1680" pageHeight="1171" math="0" shadow="0"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="2" value="&lt;b&gt;Figure 2.6 – Use Case Diagram: SD5 Settlement &amp; Oversight (UC35–UC43)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot; color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;v3.2 · 05/11/2026 · Register v1.4&lt;/font&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=15;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="10" width="1200" height="46" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c3" value="CrabShare System · SD5 Settlement &amp; Oversight" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=none;strokeColor=#1e293b;strokeWidth=1.5;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=4;fontStyle=1;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=13;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="410" y="100" width="996" height="819" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c4" value="&lt;b&gt;UC36&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Submit Settlement Feedback" style="ellipse;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#1e293b;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Segoe UI;spacing=3;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="429" y="151" width="262" height="88" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c5" value="&lt;b&gt;UC35&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Review Settlement Statement" style="ellipse;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#1e293b;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Segoe UI;spacing=3;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="429" y="269" width="262" height="88" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c6" value="&lt;b&gt;UC42&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Monitor Platform Reports" style="ellipse;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#1e293b;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Segoe UI;spacing=3;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="429" y="623" width="262" height="88" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c7" value="&lt;b&gt;UC39&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Approve Settlement and Issue Payouts" style="ellipse;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#1e293b;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Segoe UI;spacing=3;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="769" y="741" width="262" height="88" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c8" value="&lt;b&gt;UC38&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Run Settlement Calculation&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot; color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;v1.4: revenue types, tiers «planned»&lt;/font&gt;" style="ellipse;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#1e293b;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Segoe UI;spacing=3;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1109" y="151" width="262" height="88" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c9" value="&lt;b&gt;UC37&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Publish Settlement Proposal" style="ellipse;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#1e293b;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Segoe UI;spacing=3;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1109" y="269" width="262" height="88" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c10" value="&lt;b&gt;UC41&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Configure Platform Parameters&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot; color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;v1.4: deposit ratio, minimums, hold time, limits «planned»&lt;/font&gt;" style="ellipse;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#1e293b;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Segoe UI;spacing=3;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1109" y="387" width="262" height="88" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c11" value="&lt;b&gt;UC43&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Export Audit Log" style="ellipse;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#1e293b;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Segoe UI;spacing=3;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1109" y="505" width="262" height="88" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c12" value="&lt;b&gt;UC40&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Monitor Payout Reconciliation" style="ellipse;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#1e293b;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Segoe UI;spacing=3;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1109" y="741" width="262" height="88" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c13" value="Investor" style="shape=umlActor;verticalLabelPosition=bottom;verticalAlign=top;html=1;outlineConnect=0;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=13;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="140" y="207.2" width="40" height="70" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c14" value="Operator" style="shape=umlActor;verticalLabelPosition=bottom;verticalAlign=top;html=1;outlineConnect=0;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=13;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="140" y="478.6" width="40" height="70" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c15" value="Platform Administrator" style="shape=umlActor;verticalLabelPosition=bottom;verticalAlign=top;html=1;outlineConnect=0;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=13;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1540" y="632" width="40" height="70" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c16" value="«actor»&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Payment Service Provider (payment intermediary)&lt;/b&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;dashed=0;fillColor=#f8fafc;strokeColor=#475569;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1465" y="877.9" width="190" height="62" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="17" value="" style="endArrow=none;html=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c13" target="c4"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="18" value="" style="endArrow=none;html=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;entryX=0;entryY=0.38;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c13" target="c5"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="19" value="" style="endArrow=none;html=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;entryX=0;entryY=0.62;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c14" target="c5"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="20" value="" style="endArrow=none;html=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c14" target="c6"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="21" value="" style="endArrow=none;html=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;entryX=1;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c15" target="c6"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="22" value="" style="endArrow=none;html=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c15" target="c7"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="23" value="" style="endArrow=none;html=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;entryX=0.5;entryY=1;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c16" target="c7"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="24" value="" style="endArrow=none;html=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;entryX=1;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c15" target="c8"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="25" value="" style="endArrow=none;html=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;entryX=1;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c15" target="c9"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="26" value="" style="endArrow=none;html=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;entryX=1;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c15" target="c10"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="27" value="" style="endArrow=none;html=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;entryX=1;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c15" target="c11"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="28" value="" style="endArrow=none;html=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;entryX=1;entryY=0.38;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c15" target="c12"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="29" value="" style="endArrow=none;html=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;entryX=1;entryY=0.62;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c16" target="c12"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="30" value="«extend»" style="endArrow=open;endFill=0;dashed=1;html=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Segoe UI;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c4" target="c5"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="31" value="&lt;b&gt;Notes&lt;/b&gt; — UC38: the Platform Administrator starts the calculation and the settlement engine computes it. Actual revenue = revenue lines DeliveredOrder (past the return window), InvoicedSale, ForfeitedDeposit and FinalOrder; Revenue Pool = revenue − the locked Standard Cost of the funded boxes (unused cost stays with the Operator); Operator remuneration = floor(Pool × rate), only when Pool &gt; 0, cut by tier when survival (1 − deaths ÷ crabs stocked in funded boxes) is below the threshold; the rest pro rata with largest-remainder rounding; loss capped at each investor's capital, any excess borne by the Operator. UC37 opens a 7–14 day feedback window; UC36 «extend» UC35 — condition: {investor disputes own line}; UC39 only after the window closes, then the statement is locked (BR-30). UC40 follows the payout instructions at the payment intermediary. UC41: fees, minimum contribution (the floor for a row's capital), reservation hold time, deposit ratio, minimum order quantity, minimum pre-order ratio; the code configures fee tiers only (minimum contribution and deposit ratio are set per Batch, the hold time in settings). UC43 exports the hash-chained audit log. Design decisions of 05/11/2026 applied here were confirmed by the lead.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Legend&lt;/b&gt; (UML 2.5) — ellipse = use case (code + name); dashed grey with «planned» = in Register v1.4, not yet on develop @ 420a379; grey line &quot;v1.4: … «planned»&quot; = the use case exists, the v1.4 additions do not; grey fill = use case defined in another subsystem. Solid line = association (the actor takes part); hollow-triangle arrow = generalization (the child actor can do what the parent does); dashed arrow = «include» (base → included) or «extend» (extension → base, extension point and condition in the notes)." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=14;fillColor=#fffbeb;strokeColor=#d97706;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=6;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Segoe UI;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="410" y="939" width="996" height="202" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>